      prompt: "Order the post incident review and recovery sequence after a major emergency.",
      topicId: "process-emergency-post-incident-review",
      level: "class1",
      assumptions: "Fictional Ontario Class 4 water treatment system used for study. All sequences follow standard practice in the cited sources for Ontario drinking water operations under Ontario Regulation 170/03 and the Drinking Water Quality Management Standard.",
      configuration: "Scope: from emergency stand down to a stronger system than before the event.",
