        correctOptionId: "inf-b",
        explanation: "Logs place flow outside the validated envelope while an unvalidated curve still reported target dose, so the credit claim is unsupported for those days. Chlorine CT alone met the requirement, so there was no CT shortfall, and absence of adverse results does not make an unvalidated claim valid."
